silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#householdentityvariable a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#householdentityvariable" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#householdentityvariable silm:hasLongDescription "The HouseholdEntityVariable is a variable ranging over the four named household entities Mittens, Pumpkin, Vet77, Household; never a free index. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'e', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#upperlevelindexcategory a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#upperlevelindexcategory" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#upperlevelindexcategory silm:hasLongDescription "The UpperLevelIndexCategory is the four-object index category whose objects are Mittens, Pumpkin, Vet77, Household and whose arrows are the typed cross-entity reference arrows of the household. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'J^int', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#upperlevelsourcediagram a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#upperlevelsourcediagram" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#upperlevelsourcediagram silm:hasLongDescription "The UpperLevelSourceDiagram is the inclusion functor that sends each entity name e to its per-entity colimit apex colim D_e and each cross-entity reference arrow to its categorical realisation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'D^int', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#mittensapex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#mittensapex" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#mittensapex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensApex is Mittens the individual cat presented as the colimit of her observation, identifier, quality, and role legs per paper 15. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'colim D_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#pumpkinapex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#pumpkinapex" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#pumpkinapex silm:hasLongDescription "The PumpkinApex is Pumpkin the sibling cat, the second cat in the household, presented as the colimit of her own per-entity diagram. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'colim D_Pumpkin', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#vet77apex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#vet77apex" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#vet77apex silm:hasLongDescription "The Vet77Apex is Dr. Patel, the household-registered veterinarian, presented as the colimit of her DEA number, her clinic, her appointments, and her authored records. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Vet77_apex', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#householddwellingapex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#householddwellingapex" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#householddwellingapex silm:hasLongDescription "The HouseholdDwellingApex is the dwelling at 77 Maple Street, presented as the colimit of its postal address, the cat tree, the food bowls, the litter station, the microchip registry account, and the residents enrolled in it. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'colim D_Household', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#householdkg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#householdkg" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#householdkg silm:hasLongDescription "The HouseholdKG is the integrated household knowledge-graph apex, the single object resolved when the encyclopedia is asked \"return the entire household ontology\". In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'HouseholdKG', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#integrationmediator a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#integrationmediator" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#integrationmediator silm:hasLongDescription "The IntegrationMediator is the unique cocone-mediator arrow HouseholdKG -> colim D_e for entity e; iota_Mittens is the household-to-cat arrow that strictly does NOT collapse the household onto Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'iota_e', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#microchipidentifiesarrow a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#microchipidentifiesarrow" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#microchipidentifiesarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The MicrochipIdentifiesArrow is the cross-entity identity-leg arrow colim D_Mittens -> colim D_Pumpkin that links the two cats through their shared household microchip registry without collapsing them. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'microchip_identifies', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#memberofarrow a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#memberofarrow" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#memberofarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The MemberOfArrow is the typed household-membership arrow colim D_e -> colim D_Household; e is enrolled as a resident. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'member_of', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#seesaspatientarrow a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#seesaspatientarrow" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#seesaspatientarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The SeesAsPatientArrow is the typed professional-relation arrow Vet77_apex -> colim D_cat; Dr. Patel sees the cat as a patient. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'sees_as_patient', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#crossrefersarrow a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#crossrefersarrow" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#crossrefersarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The CrossRefersArrow is the typed evidence cross-reference arrow Vet77_apex -> colim D_Household; the vet records cite the household as a billable site of care. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'cross_refers', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#annualbill77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#annualbill77" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#annualbill77 silm:hasLongDescription "The AnnualBill77 is a concrete competing cocone target: AnnualBill77, the household's annual vet-bill query result, which receives one alpha_e arrow from each per-entity apex and a unique mediator u from HouseholdKG. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'X', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#annualbillcoconearrow a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#annualbillcoconearrow" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#annualbillcoconearrow silm:hasLongDescription "The AnnualBillCoconeArrow is the per-entity component of the AnnualBill77 cocone: alpha_Mittens lists Mittens's vet visits, alpha_Pumpkin lists Pumpkin's, alpha_Vet77 lists the vet's authored invoices, alpha_Household resolves the billing address." .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#annualbillmediator a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph.chapters.01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits.sections.01_higher_order_index_category.concrete_anchors#annualbillmediator" .
silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_concrete_anchors#annualbillmediator silm:hasLongDescription "The AnnualBillMediator is the unique mediator HouseholdKG -> AnnualBill77 promised by the universal property; the encyclopedia's formal warrant for \"one annual bill for the whole household\". In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'u', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
